#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# differential_root

#% text
# `differential_root(f)` stands for the function defined by `f(y, x)`: a list of a linear ordinary differential equation for y(x) and its initial values at one point. `differential_root(f)(x0)` gives its value at an inexact real x0.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# Written form: equal definitions are written alike. The formal names are `FormalY` and `FormalX`; the equation is P == 0, where P is the numerator of lhs - rhs over a common denominator, collected in y(x), y'(x), ... with expanded coefficients, its content free of x divided out and the coefficient of the highest derivative with a positive first number; the terms free of y come first, then the derivatives by increasing order; the initial values follow by order.

#% item
# At an inexact real x0 the value is computed by `n_dsolve_value` from the initial point to x0; at an inexact complex x0 along the segment from the initial point (real and imaginary parts as a real system). At an exact number the value is that of the closed form `d_solve_value` finds, when the leading coefficient is constant; otherwise the call stays as it is.

#% item
# `d` in x gives the differential_root of the derivative (same order), `integrate` in x an antiderivative as a differential_root (same order when the operator is exact, one more otherwise), and `series` at the initial point the Taylor series from the equation.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
differential_root((y, x) => [y'(x) - y(x) == 0, y(0) == 1])(0.5)
#% output
#= 1.6487212707001309

#% cell
differential_root((y, x) => [y''(x) + y(x) == 0, y(0) == 0, y'(0) == 1])(1.0)
#% output
#= 0.8414709848078933

#% cell
differential_root((y, x) => [x*y''(x) + y'(x) - y(x) == 0, y(1/2) == 1, y'(1/2) == -3/4])
#% output
#= differential_root((FormalY, FormalX) => [-FormalY(FormalX) + FormalY'(FormalX) + FormalX*FormalY''(FormalX) == 0, FormalY(1/2) == 1, FormalY'(1/2) == -3/4])

#% cell
d(differential_root((y, x) => [y'(x) - y(x) + 4*x^2 == 0, y(0) == 1])(x), x)
#% output
#= differential_root((FormalY, FormalX) => [8*FormalX - FormalY(FormalX) + FormalY'(FormalX) == 0, FormalY(0) == 1])(x)

#% cell
integrate(differential_root((y, x) => [y'''(x) + 2*x*y''(x) - y(x) == 0, y(1/2) == 1, y'(1/2) == -3/4, y''(1/2) == 0])(x), x)
#% output
#= differential_root((FormalY, FormalX) => [-FormalY(FormalX) - 2*FormalY'(FormalX) + 2*FormalX*FormalY''(FormalX) + FormalY'''(FormalX) == 0, FormalY(1/2) == -11/4, FormalY'(1/2) == 1, FormalY''(1/2) == -3/4])(x)

#% cell
series(differential_root((y, x) => [y'''(x) + 2*x*y''(x) - y(x) == 0, y(1/2) == 1, y'(1/2) == -3/4, y''(1/2) == 0])(x), x, 1/2, 4)
#% output
#= 1 - 3*(x - 1/2)/4 + (x - 1/2)^3/6 - 7*(x - 1/2)^4/96 + O((x - 1/2)^5)

#% cell
differential_root((y, x) => [y''(x) + y(x) == 0, y(0) == 0, y'(0) == 1])(pi/2)
#% output
#= 1

#% cell
differential_root((y, x) => [x*y''(x) + y'(x) - y(x) == 0, y(1/2) == 1, y'(1/2) == -3/4])(0.5 + 1.0im)
#% output
#= 0.4054499458920219 + 0.001975181742031211im

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `difference_root`, `n_dsolve_value`, `d_solve`
